  "description": "Non-material amendment to planning permission ref: 2024/02858/FUL granted 4th March 2025 for the 'Formation of a lightwell to the side elevation, in connection with the existing basement; increase in the floorspace at basement level by utilising ancillary floorspace from the rear part of commercial units No. 592 and No. 594 Fulham Road; installation of 1no. rooflight to the existing front roof slope; installation of 2no. rooflights to the existing side roofslope; installation of a new window to the side elevation at ground floor level.' Amendments sought to include: Basement Lightwell Foyer Opening - changing the locations of the approved sash window and flood door within the basement lightwell foyer elevation; Bedroom 1 - Lightwell Window Specification: frame orientation changed from vertical to horizontal; Fixed Lightwell Fire Escape Ladder: introduction of a permanently fixed escape ladder within the lightwell, securely mounted to the retaining wall; Front railing escape gate: installation of a new opening to the approved metal railing on the Kelvedon Road frontage.",
